<title>FINLAND: TALENTUM TO BOOK PROFIT ON MTV SHARE SALE.</title>
<headline>TALENTUM TO BOOK PROFIT ON MTV SHARE SALE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish publishing house Talentum Oy said in a statement on Monday it had sold 1,000 shares in commercial television company MTV Oy and would book a sales profit of about 20 million markka.</p>
<p>It did not identify the buyer.  </p>
<p>Talentum said it still owned 2,259 MTV shares or 4.1 percent of the share capital.</p>
<p>MTV and media group Aamulehti-yhtyma Oy have agreed to merge from the start of 1998 and MTV shares will be exchanged for shares in the new group at a ratio of 137.5 new company shares for each MTV share.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
